  "amruts-197-lakh-crore-urban-portfolio": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/Water_dripping_out_of_an_urban_water_supply_pipeline_in_India_20120311.jpg/960px-Water_dripping_out_of_an_urban_water_supply_pipeline_in_India_20120311.jpg\" alt=\"Water dripping from an urban water supply pipeline in India\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Water supply is the single most capital-intensive line item in AMRUT 2.0's portfolio &mdash; 41% of projects but 60% of the money. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Water_dripping_out_of_an_urban_water_supply_pipeline_in_India_20120311.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Water dripping out of an urban water supply pipeline in India</a>, Ganesh Dhamodkar, CC BY-SA 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
    "chart_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212529\">AMRUT 2.0: Cost by Component</text>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#495057\">₹ crore, of ₹1,97,201.55 cr total (8,777 projects)</text>\n<line x1=\"180\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"365\" stroke=\"#212529\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Water Supply</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"480\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"666\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">₹1,18,953 cr (60%)</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Sewerage & Septage</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"287\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"473\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">₹71,157 cr (36%)</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Water Body Rejuv.</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"150\" width=\"24\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#495057\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">₹6,004 cr (3%)</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Parks & Green Space</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"190\" width=\"5\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"199\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">₹1,088 cr (0.6%)</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  "brandsafway-and-2017-roll-up-wave-that": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/79/Scaffolding_for_a_building_under_construction.jpg/960px-Scaffolding_for_a_building_under_construction.jpg\" alt=\"Scaffolding on a building under construction\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Scaffolding and access services were the fragmented, capital-intensive industry that BrandSafway, Altrad and United Rentals each moved to consolidate in 2017. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scaffolding_for_a_building_under_construction.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scaffolding for a building under construction</a>, రవిచంద్ర, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
    "chart_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212529\">From a $965M Deal to a $6.7B Company</text>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#495057\">Deal and valuation figures cited in this piece, USD</text>\n<line x1=\"180\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"365\" stroke=\"#212529\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">NES Rentals deal (2017)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"69\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"255\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">$965M</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Brookfield equity check (2019)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"93\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#495057\"/><text x=\"279\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">$1.3B</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">BrandSafway valuation (2019)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"150\" width=\"480\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"666\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">$6.7B</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  "brazil-pumps-e30-at-every-station": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Ethanol_fuel_pump_Brazil.jpg/960px-Ethanol_fuel_pump_Brazil.jpg\" alt=\"An ethanol fuel pump at a filling station in Brazil\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Brazil has sold ethanol-blended petrol at every pump since 1938; a separate pump at the same station sells pure ethanol (E100) for flex-fuel cars. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ethanol_fuel_pump_Brazil.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ethanol fuel pump Brazil</a>, Harry Wood, CC BY-SA 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
    "chart_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212529\">Brazil's Gasolina C Ethanol Blend, 1993–2025</text>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#495057\">% anhydrous ethanol in regular petrol, selected years</text>\n<line x1=\"180\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"365\" stroke=\"#212529\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">1993</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"65\" width=\"352\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"538\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">22%</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">2007</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"101\" width=\"400\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"586\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">25%</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">2011</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"137\" width=\"288\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"474\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">18%</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">2015</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"173\" width=\"432\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"618\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">27%</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">2025</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"209\" width=\"480\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"666\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">30%</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  "dgh-has-awarded-172-oalp-blocks-and-436": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg/960px-ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg\" alt=\"An ONGC offshore oil and gas platform\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">ONGC, one of the few bidders in recent OALP rounds, operates the kind of offshore platform this piece's exploration-block awards are meant to bring online. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ONGC Oil Platform</a>, Nandu Chitnis, CC BY 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
    "chart_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212529\">OALP: Awards vs. Outcomes</text>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#495057\">Blocks, discoveries & production, backed by $4.36bn in pledges</text>\n<line x1=\"180\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"365\" stroke=\"#212529\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Blocks awarded (thru Rd IX)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"480\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"666\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">172</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Discoveries reported</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"39\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">14</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Fields in production</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"150\" width=\"4\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">1</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  "dgh-has-awarded-172-oalp-blocks-and-436_01077708555": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg/960px-ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg\" alt=\"An ONGC offshore oil and gas platform\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">ONGC remains one of the largest bidders across DGH's OALP rounds, the acreage-licensing system this piece examines. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ONGC Oil Platform</a>, Nandu Chitnis, CC BY 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
    "chart_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212529\">OALP Blocks Awarded, By Round</text>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#495057\">Number of exploration blocks awarded per bidding round</text>\n<line x1=\"180\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"365\" stroke=\"#212529\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Rounds I–VII</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"480\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"666\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">134 blocks</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Round IX</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"100\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">28 blocks</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Round X</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"150\" width=\"90\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#495057\"/><text x=\"276\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">25 blocks</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Round XI</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"190\" width=\"75\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"261\" y=\"199\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">21 blocks</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  "dgh-has-awarded-172-oalp-blocks-and-436_0369361351": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg/960px-ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg\" alt=\"An ONGC offshore oil and gas platform\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">An ONGC platform of the kind now producing from the single marginal Gujarat gas field this piece traces back to its OALP award. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ONGC_Oil_Platform.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ONGC Oil Platform</a>, Nandu Chitnis, CC BY 2.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
    "chart_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212529\">Two Sources, Close Numbers</text>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#495057\">OALP blocks & discoveries: trade press vs. Lok Sabha answer</text>\n<line x1=\"180\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"365\" stroke=\"#212529\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"74\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Blocks (Whalesbook)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"65\" width=\"480\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"666\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">172</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Blocks (Lok Sabha)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"101\" width=\"402\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"588\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">144</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Discoveries (Whalesbook)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"137\" width=\"39\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"225\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">14</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Discoveries (Lok Sabha)</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"173\" width=\"36\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"222\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">13</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  "everyone-worries-about-who-pays-for": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Cooling_tower_in_CSEB_west_thermal_power_plant_darri%2C_Korba_Chhattisgarh.jpg/960px-Cooling_tower_in_CSEB_west_thermal_power_plant_darri%2C_Korba_Chhattisgarh.jpg\" alt=\"Cooling tower of a coal-fired thermal power plant in Korba, Chhattisgarh, India\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Power plants are among the 765 emission sources CEEW's proposed CO2 pipeline network would connect to underground storage &mdash; but capture, not the pipeline, is where most of the cost sits. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cooling_tower_in_CSEB_west_thermal_power_plant_darri,_Korba_Chhattisgarh.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Cooling tower in CSEB west thermal power plant darri, Korba Chhattisgarh</a>, Mettle30, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
    "chart_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;max-width:700px;display:block;margin:0 auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"700\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#212529\">Pipelines Are the Cheap Part</text>\n<text x=\"350\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#495057\">Cost per tonne of CO2 in India, upper-bound estimates (₹)</text>\n<line x1=\"180\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"365\" stroke=\"#212529\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Pipeline transport</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"70\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#1a8f4c\"/><text x=\"201\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">well under ₹400/t</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"119\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">Capture cost</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"110\" width=\"166\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#0b5394\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">up to ₹4,500/t</text>\n<text x=\"175\" y=\"159\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#212529\">All-in cost</text>\n<rect x=\"180\" y=\"150\" width=\"480\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"666\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">₹8,000–13,000+/t</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
  },
  "fipis-biggest-ask-is-getting-natural": {
    "picture_html": "<figure style=\"margin:1.6rem 0\">\n<img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/%E0%B4%AA%E0%B5%86%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B0%E0%B5%8B%E0%B4%A8%E0%B5%86%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D_%E0%B4%8E%E0%B5%BD.%E0%B4%8E%E0%B5%BB.%E0%B4%9C%E0%B4%BF.%E0%B4%AF%E0%B5%81%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%86_%E0%B4%B5%E0%B4%BE%E0%B4%A4%E0%B4%95_%E0%B4%9F%E0%B4%BE%E0%B4%99%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%81%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%BE.jpg/960px-%E0%B4%AA%E0%B5%86%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B0%E0%B5%8B%E0%B4%A8%E0%B5%86%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D_%E0%B4%8E%E0%B5%BD.%E0%B4%8E%E0%B5%BB.%E0%B4%9C%E0%B4%BF.%E0%B4%AF%E0%B5%81%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%86_%E0%B4%B5%E0%B4%BE%E0%B4%A4%E0%B4%95_%E0%B4%9F%E0%B4%BE%E0%B4%99%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%81%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%BE.jpg\" alt=\"Petronet LNG storage tanks at Puthuvype, Kochi\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:6px;display:block\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Natural gas, the fuel FIPI's members sell and want brought under GST, still sits outside the GST system &mdash; taxed instead under the older excise-plus-VAT regime. <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E0%B4%AA%E0%B5%86%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B0%E0%B5%8B%E0%B4%A8%E0%B5%86%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%B1%E0%B5%8D_%E0%B4%8E%E0%B5%BD.%E0%B4%8E%E0%B5%BB.%E0%B4%9C%E0%B4%BF.%E0%B4%AF%E0%B5%81%E0%B4%9F%E0%B5%86_%E0%B4%B5%E0%B4%BE%E0%B4%A4%E0%B4%95_%E0%B4%9F%E0%B4%BE%E0%B4%99%E0%B5%8D%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%81%E0%B4%95%E0%B5%BE.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">പെട്രോനെറ്റ് എൽ.എൻ.ജി.യുടെ വാതക ടാങ്കുകൾ</a>, Drajay1976, CC BY-SA 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons.</figcaption>\n</figure>",
